Z||000000||Blondie88||10-12-2001||11:10 PM||||My neice Jade just took her first step today!  She took four steps in a row and then fell down.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I guess she started laughing, clapping and screaming because she made my sister so happy.  Well, thought I would share that with you!  She's 11 months right now.  OH!  I'll even give a picture, just for those who like looking at babies.  It's old, but it'll have to do!  <BR> <A HREF="http://www.the-onramp.net/ceo/mothers_day/DSCN0043.JPG" TARGET=_blank>http://www.the-onramp.net/ceo/mothers_day/DSCN0043.JPG</A> <P>This is Jade at 6 months old.  She's not smiling like she usually is, but anyways, i'm going to go.  Have fun!||||reg||1
